  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 523.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 523.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) This part shall apply to dredging projects in non-tidal jurisdictional areas.\n\n(b) Where dredging is part of a larger project, it shall also be reviewed under the appropriate project specific section as follows:\n\n(1) Dredging projects for pond construction shall be reviewed under Env-Wt 519;\n\n(2) Dredging for residential, commercial, or industrial development shall be reviewed under Env-Wt 524; and\n\n(3) Dredging associated with restoration/enhancement activities shall be reviewed under Env-Wt 525.\n\n(c) This part shall not apply to dredging that:\n\n(1) Meets the criteria for small motor mineral dredging under RSA 482-A:3, XI, and complies with Env-Wt 310.04 through Env-Wt 310.08; or\n\n(2) Is an integral component of a dam project that meets the criteria of Env-Wt 526.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
}
